{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The shepherds kept their flocks by night
On Bethlehem's cold hill
When [F]all around them shone the [C]light
And [G]everything was still
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Glory to God in the [F]highest
And [G]peace on earth be[C]low
Glory to God in the [F]highest
Let [G]all the people [C]know
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Unto you is born this day
A Savior, Christ the Lord
Go [F]find him where the cattle [C]lay
And [G]tell abroad the word
{end_of_verse}

